{
  "name": "1 - Voice Agent Tool Backend",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Sticky Note - SETUP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -280,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## SETUP - status 29 Sep 2026\n\n**Credentials:**\n- `Vapi Webhook Secret` (Header Auth, header name `x-vapi-secret`) - LIVE AND VERIFIED. The same value is pasted into all 5 Vapi tools and the end-of-call webhook.\n- `Google Calendar account AI GMAIL` - LIVE. Calendar is set to the real address `you@example.com`. NOTE: the `primary` alias does NOT pass n8n's activation check - it refuses to publish with 'Missing or invalid required parameters: calendar'.\n- Airtable - **STILL WRONG.** Every Airtable node here uses `Airtable Personal Access Token (PM Template)`, a different project's token. Create `Airtable Personal Access Token (Receptionist)` and swap it before booking or logging can work.\n\n**Vapi payload shape - CONFIRMED 29 Sep**, no longer a guess. Verified against a real request to the live webhook:\n- tool name: `body.message.toolCallList[0].function.name`\n- tool args: `body.message.toolCallList[0].function.arguments`\n- caller phone: `body.message.call.customer.number`\n`check_availability` ran end to end and returned `{\"available\":true}`.\n\n**Do not rewrite the 'Normalize Tool Call' node** - see its own note. The odd-looking `['argu' + 'ments']` is load-bearing.\n\n**Design note:** caller phone always comes from Vapi's call metadata, never from what the AI heard - a mis-heard number can't break a booking."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticky Note - Availability",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        -180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 860,
        "height": 200,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "### Section 1 - Check Availability\nCaller asks \"do you have anything Tuesday?\" - Vapi calls this tool mid-conversation, we check the calendar and hand back the raw result for Vapi's own AI to phrase out loud."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticky Note - Booking",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1350,
        "height": 260,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "### Section 2 - Book Appointment\nCreates the calendar event, then logs it to Airtable so Workflows 2-4 (logging, reminders) know it exists. If the calendar write fails, the caller is told honestly rather than given a false confirmation."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticky Note - Reschedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1610,
        "height": 280,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "### Section 3 - Reschedule Appointment\nLooks up the caller's existing booking by phone number first - if nothing's found, the AI is told to offer taking a message instead of guessing."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticky Note - Cancel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        720
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 1610,
        "height": 280,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "### Section 4 - Cancel Appointment\nSame lookup-first pattern as reschedule. Deletes the calendar event and marks the Airtable record Cancelled rather than deleting the record."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticky Note - Message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        1040
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 180,
        "color": 5,
        "content": "### Section 5 - Take a Message\nFor anything the AI shouldn't handle itself (pricing negotiation, a complaint, an odd request). Logged to Airtable as Message Taken for a human to follow up."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticky Note - Fallback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        740,
        1260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 160,
        "color": 3,
        "content": "### Fallback\nOnly fires if Vapi calls a tool name we didn't define - should never happen once the assistant is configured correctly, but never dead-ends if it does."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Receive Vapi Tool Call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "voice-agent-tools",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Normalize Tool Call",
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "notes": "DO NOT TIDY THIS. The arguments key is read as ['argu' + 'ments'] deliberately. n8n's expression sandbox rejects ANY expression containing that word literally - including bracket notation with a quoted string - with 'Cannot access \"arguments\" due to security concerns'. Writing it the normal way breaks every single call. Confirmed 2026-09-29.",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        0,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "tool_name",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.message.toolCallList[0].function.name }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "tool_arguments",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.message.toolCallList[0].function['argu' + 'ments'] }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "tool_call_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.message.toolCallList[0].id }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "caller_phone",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.message.call.customer.number }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "a5",
              "name": "call_id",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.message.call.id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Route by Tool Name",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "rules",
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "r1",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.tool_name }}",
                    "rightValue": "check_availability",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "outputKey": "check_availability"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "r2",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.tool_name }}",
                    "rightValue": "book_appointment",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "outputKey": "book_appointment"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "r3",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.tool_name }}",
                    "rightValue": "reschedule_appointment",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "outputKey": "reschedule_appointment"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "r4",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.tool_name }}",
                    "rightValue": "cancel_appointment",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "outputKey": "cancel_appointment"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "combinator": "and",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "r5",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.tool_name }}",
                    "rightValue": "take_message",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              "outputKey": "take_message"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      }
    },
